      "description": "Citron action for signing in and continuing to reviews.",
      "html": "<button class=\"ds-sq-primary\">Read reviews <svg viewBox=\"0 0 24 24\" width=\"20\" height=\"20\" fill=\"none\" stroke=\"currentColor\" stroke-width=\"1.6\" stroke-linecap=\"round\" stroke-linejoin=\"round\" aria-hidden=\"true\"><path d=\"M4 12h15m-6-6 6 6-6 6\"/></svg></button>",
