      "html": "<article class=\"ds-sq-review\"><div class=\"ds-sq-author\"><span class=\"ds-sq-initial\">A</span><div>Alex Morgan<small>PC</small></div></div><div class=\"ds-sq-writing\"><p>Updated after more runs: Hades remains a sharp, generous roguelike.</p><a href=\"https://portfolios.appcalipse.com\">View profile <svg viewBox=\"0 0 24 24\" width=\"20\" height=\"20\" fill=\"none\" stroke=\"currentColor\" stroke-width=\"1.6\" stroke-linecap=\"round\" stroke-linejoin=\"round\" aria-hidden=\"true\"><path d=\"M7 17 17 7M7 7h10v10\"/></svg></a></div></article>",
      "css": ".ds-sq-review{display:grid;grid-template-columns:190px minmax(0,1fr);gap:30px;padding:30px;background:var(--surface,#17191c);color:var(--ink,#f5f6f0);border-radius:12px;font:13px 'DM Sans',sans-serif}.ds-sq-author{display:flex;gap:12px;align-items:start}.ds-sq-initial{display:grid;place-items:center;flex:none;width:42px;height:42px;border-radius:50%;background:#353d24;color:var(--accent,#e5fa36);font-weight:650}.ds-sq-author small{display:block;margin-top:8px;color:var(--muted,#aeb2b4);font-size:11px}.ds-sq-writing{min-width:0}.ds-sq-writing p{font-size:15px;line-height:1.85;max-width:70ch;white-space:pre-wrap;overflow-wrap:anywhere;margin:0 0 20px}.ds-sq-writing a{display:inline-flex;gap:8px;align-items:center;font-size:11px;color:var(--muted,#aeb2b4);text-decoration:none}.ds-sq-writing a svg{width:14px;height:14px}.ds-sq-writing a:hover{color:var(--accent,#e5fa36)}.ds-sq-writing a:focus-visible{outline:2px solid var(--accent,#e5fa36);outline-offset:3px;}@media(max-width:800px){.ds-sq-review{grid-template-columns:1fr;gap:18px}}@media(max-width:540px){.ds-sq-review{padding:22px 18px}}",
